# Density Compare
# Vanadium (V) — real density 6.11 g/cm³. equal masses: Vanadium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Vanadium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.9mm color: #a6a6ab at (-20mm, 5.5mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 48.7 g — the water cube is the reference
